ness of the oppressor (? AV) would then be the only use of the word of other than God's anger; here ᵑ7 ᵐ5 Ew Hi Gf Ke Che Gie RV rightly read חרב oppressing sword (as 46:16 ; 50:16 ). חרון is not used in H P D 2 or E (except song, Exod 15:7 ) of the Hexateuch; nor in Ezekiel except Ezek 7:12 (strike out Co), 7:14 .","rootNote":"or (shortened) חָרֹן ; from 2734 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 28 18","keyReferences":["1Sam 28 18","2Chr 28 11","2Chr 28 13","2Chr 29 10","2Chr 30 8","2Kgs 23 26","Deut 13 18","Exod 15 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":41,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 28 18","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲרוֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 28 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":28,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲר֥וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 28 13","book":"2Chr","chapter":28,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲר֥וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 10","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲר֥וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 30 8","book":"2Chr","chapter":30,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲר֥וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 23 26","book":"2Kgs","chapter":23,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/חֲר֤וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Deut 13 18","book":"Deut","chapter":13,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/חֲר֣וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 15 7","book":"Exod","chapter":15,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲרֹ֣נְ/ךָ֔","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp2ms"},{"reference":"Exod 32 12","book":"Exod","chapter":32,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מֵ/חֲר֣וֹן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 